
@startuml

skinparam {
    DiagramBorderThickness 1
    RectangleBorderThickness 1
    SequenceParticipantBorderThickness 1
    SequenceReferenceBorderThickness 1
    SequenceGroupBorderThickness 1
    SequenceActorBorderThickness 1
    sequenceMessageAlign center
    Gainsboro true
    hide footbox
    Monochrome true
    PartitionFontSize 10
    RoundCorner 10
}

title  **获取ecuInfo时序图** 
hide footbox

participant ECM
participant EIM
participant DIM
participant KV

alt 从数据库中获取ecuInfo
EIM->KV:读数据库获取ecuInfo
activate EIM
activate KV
EIM<--KV:返回ecuInfo
deactivate KV
EIM->EIM:返回序列化的字符串或者结构体数据
deactivate EIM

else 从DIM中实时获取ecuInfo
EIM->ECM:获取零件配置
activate EIM
activate ECM
EIM<--ECM:返回零件配置
deactivate ECM
EIM->EIM:序列化配置
EIM->DIM:获取所有ecuInfo
activate DIM
EIM<--DIM:返回ecuInfo
deactivate DIM
EIM->EIM:序列化返回ecuInfo
EIM->KV:保存ecuInfo到KV；覆盖老的ecuInfo
activate KV
EIM<--KV:返回结果
deactivate KV
EIM->EIM:返回序列化的字符串或者结构体数据
deactivate EIM

else 周期获取ecuInfo
EIM->ECM:获取零件配置
activate EIM
activate ECM
EIM<--ECM:返回零件配置
deactivate ECM

EIM->KV:查询已经获取过的ecuInfo
activate KV
EIM<--KV:返回查询结果
deactivate KV

EIM->EIM:通过零件配置与本地已经获取过的ecu对比；\n找出未获取的ecu

note left of EIM:找出未采集的ecu

loop 采集未获取的ecuInfo:循环从DIM获取单个ecuInfo
EIM->DIM:获取单个ecuInfo
activate DIM
EIM<--DIM:返回单个ecuInfo
deactivate DIM
EIM->EIM:序列化单个ecuInfo

EIM->KV:保存单个ecuInfo到KV
activate KV
EIM<--KV:返回结果
note left of EIM:为了保证断电重启后，\n已经采集过的ecuInfo不再采集
deactivate KV
end

loop 读出所有的ecuInfo:循环从KV中获取单个ecuInfo
EIM->KV:获取单个ecuInfo
activate KV
EIM<--KV:返回结果
deactivate KV
end

EIM->EIM:合并所有单个ecuInfo为总的ecuInfo
EIM->KV:保存总的ecuInfo到KV
activate KV
EIM<--KV:返回结果
deactivate KV

loop 删除所有的单个ecuInfo:循环从KV中删除单个ecuInfo
EIM->KV:删除单个ecuInfo
activate KV
EIM<--KV:返回结果
deactivate KV
end
note left of EIM:此时KV中只剩下总的ecuInfo，\n所有单个ecuInfo被清除
EIM->EIM:等待下次周期获取ecuInfo

end
@enduml

